body:
This PR updates TVM_FFI_STATIC_INIT_BLOCK to function style.
Now we do the code as follows, which is cleaner in generally
and also helps error reporting to locate the right place.

TVM_FFI_STATIC_INIT_BLOCK() {
  RegisterStaffs();
}

